# User-View Testing

Follow `docs/USER_VIEW_TESTING.md` and `.cursor/rules/cursor-browser-ui.mdc`.

## UI tasks

1. `npm run dev:frontend` → http://127.0.0.1:5174/
2. Real browser check (cursor-ide-browser, playwright, or chrome-devtools)
3. Console + network for API errors
4. `python3 scripts/user_view_test.py` and/or `npm run test:ui`

## Translation pipeline UI

- Verify REAL_API / MOCK / DRY_RUN indicators visible
